      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Queue Invariant:\n- Q holds all vertices with in-degree = 0 (ready)\n- Dequeue u: append u to topological order\n- For each (u -> v): decrement in-degree(v)\n- If in-degree(v) == 0: enqueue v into Q",
      "originalText": "Queue Invariant:\n- Q holds all vertices with in-degree = 0 (ready)\n- Dequeue u: append u to topological order\n- For each (u -> v): decrement in-degree(v)\n- If in-degree(v) == 0: enqueue v into Q",
